TensorFlow’s API protos ultimately pull-in a long dependency chain:

tensorflow_serving/apis → tensorflow/core/framework/*.proto 
 → tensorflow/core/protobuf/*.proto 
 → tsl/protobuf/*.proto 
 → xla/tsl/protobuf/*.proto 
